on of the Spanish Inquisition in the 15th century and the expulsion of the Jews in 1492; the encounter between the Old and the New Worlds; the 'opposition' of high and low in popular culture, and of the secular and the sacred in poetry and prose. Readings may be drawn from medieval short stories and miracle collections; chivalric romances, Columbus, Lazarillo de Tormes, Cervantes, Lope de Vega, Calder?and Sor Juana Ines de la Cruz, among others.", "catalogBreadth": null, "catalogDistr": null, "catalogEnrollmentPriority": "", "catalogLang": null, "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": null, "catalogAttribute": null, "catalogWhenOffered": null, "catalogComments": null, "catalogPrereqCoreq": null, "catalogPrereq": "SPAN 2095 or Cornell Advanced Standing Exam (CASE) score of Q++.", "catalogCoreq": "", "catalogFee": null, "catalogSatisfiesReq": null, "catalogPermission": null, "catalogCourseSubfield": null, "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AS", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2026FA, 2026SP, 2025FA, 2025SP", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2937, "crseId": 353084, "crseOfferNbr": 2, "subject": "LATA", "catalogNbr": "3613", "titleShort": "Steel Band", "titleLong": "Cornell Steel Band", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0004", "crseAttrValue": "AFAREA", "descr": "Africana Studies Area", "descrformal": "Africana Studies Area", "attrDescr": "Exploratory Studies", "attrDescrShort": "ExplStudy"}, {"crseAttr": "0004", "crseAttrValue": "LAAREA", "descr": "Latin American Studies Area", "descrformal": "Latin American Studies Area", "attrDescr": "Exploratory Studies", "attrDescrShort": "ExplStudy"}, {"crseAttr": "0015", "crseAttrValue": "MUSIC-PL", "descr": "MUSIC-Performance and Lessons", "descrformal": "MUSIC-Performance and Lessons", "attrDescr": "Program Requirements", "at